    "hint": "Participation can begin with supports; it need not wait for a child to become indistinguishable from peers.",
    "e": "Inclusive early education with individualized accommodations supports participation and learning. A developmental difference is not a reason for blanket exclusion; specific needs should guide the supports and safety plan.",
