    "hint": "Reduce barriers to receiving the message before interpreting missed directions as behaviour.",
    "e": "Environmental and communication accommodations can improve access, including seating, visual support, reduced noise and functioning hearing technology where prescribed. Persistent concerns should be reviewed with family and hearing professionals.",
