    "hint": "Prevent injury and maintain a clear airway; do not restrain or place objects in the mouth.",
    "e": "During a seizure, clear hazards, cushion the head, time the episode and position safely when possible. Do not restrain or place objects or fluids in the mouth; seek emergency help for prolonged seizures, repeated seizures, injury or breathing difficulty.",
