    "hint": "Growth monitoring is a screening and tracking tool, not a disease-specific test.",
    "e": "Growth charts help track size and trajectory but do not diagnose a particular condition. Persistent symptoms or poor growth need clinician evaluation and indicated laboratory testing.",
